---- MODULE BoxOffice ----
\* Exercise 4 starter. You write this module. The task in EXERCISES.md says
\* what goes in it, and `BoxOffice.cfg` next door is already written, so it
\* pins the constant and the two invariant names for you.
\*
\* Run it as it stands and you get `CONFIG_ERROR`, because the config names
\* two invariants this file does not define yet. That is the starting point,
\* not a problem to fix in the config.
